# (build 163) The Escape menu's LANGUAGE (docs/languages.md), above QUIT
# as GAMEPAD is, so the rows routes count to keep their places. On the
# title: down nine is LANGUAGE, ENGLISH 1989 -- the route's settings.json
# names none, so the cartridge's. C steps on to RETRANSLATED, (165)
# JAPANESE, and round to ENGLISH 1989; left and right step back and on. The
# value is drawn in the stock font, as the whole menu is in every
# language. The waits put the cursor's lamp in its lit half.
start new
wait screen title
press esc
expect escape-menu open
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down                   # LANGUAGE
expect setting language us
wait ticks 7
shot 01_language
press c
expect setting language retranslation
wait ticks 14
shot 02_retranslated
press c
expect setting language ja
wait ticks 14
shot 03_japanese
press c                      # round to the first
expect setting language us
press left                   # round back to the last
expect setting language ja
press right
expect setting language us
press right
expect setting language retranslation
press b
expect escape-menu closed
expect screen title
